  "prompt": "How many units did each store city sell from 3 to 9 March 2025? order_ts holds UTC time: an order counts when its UTC date is from 3 to 9 March 2025, both days included. Return two columns, in this order: city and units, the total quantity of the order lines. Return one row for each city with sales in that week. Any row order is fine.",
